Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:07.74,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You worked really well today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:08.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.83,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You learn things fast and do them right, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.75,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You could be well-suited for this kind of job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:17.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Could it be... Are you complimenting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:20.17,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Don't get let it get to your head, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:23.88,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,We're doing the same thing every day,\Nso of course you'd improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:25.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.39,0:00:37.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All those people I studied with back then went to college and must be in some city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:39.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:42.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I'm not by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:47.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There are people who get covered in dirt and grime every day like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:52.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's the new place I've chosen and have earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:16.69,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:16.69,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf24}ki{\kf23}mi {\kf20}da{\kf22}ke {\kf33}ga {\kf32}su{\kf19}gi{\kf27}sa{\kf19}t{\kf39}ta {\kf48}sa{\kf43}ka {\kf42}no {\kf39}to{\kf24}chu{\kf29}u {\kf75}wa
