Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:28.34,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Now, here's a quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.63,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.63,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Here he goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:35.97,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Which of the following is this summer's first big event I came up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:38.14,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,One: BBQ at the Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:40.14,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Two: RIP at the Beach
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:42.56,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Three: Barbara Fujioka at the Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:45.11,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,They all sound so similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:46.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The last one was completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.61,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,The "bar" sound is the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.61,0:02:50.74,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You go play with Barbara Fujioka alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:51.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who is that, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:55.16,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I haven't had a chance to play with Nagisa, so I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:57.74,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I don't care what it is; I just want some time with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:02:58.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:06.17,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's natural for you two to spend a lot of time together, but it's hard to let go of one's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:07.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:09.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is it something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:14.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 12
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:14.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Unexpected Incident
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:18.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your place is really lively as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:22.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:27.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, there's something I want to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:31.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What? You want a swimsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:33.11,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:37.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Oh, but it's not that I don't want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:41.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right then. I get out early tomorrow, so let's go buy one tomorrow evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:43.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What? Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:46.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I bet you only have a school swimsuit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:49.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. But I don't mind that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:51.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:54.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,After all, you want to see your girlfriend looking cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Be the beach queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:59.89,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What? Me in a swimsuit is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:04.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't say that. We'll have fun shopping tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:04.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:06.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right, then-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:08.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's not what I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:11.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It wasn't a swimsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:12.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:13.07,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.16,0:04:22.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, have you met with\Nyour father properly after you've moved?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:26.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Have you told him your new address?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:28.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:33.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You know that there's a distance between me and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:37.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's a distance that can never be closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.43,0:04:37.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:40.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm working every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.27,0:04:44.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm working until I'm completely exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:48.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I want to be with you at least on my days off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:50.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't want to do anything unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:54.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to be now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.03,0:04:59.57,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Let's go meet him together one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:01.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:02.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,One day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:06.37,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. One day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:17.68,Signs,Man,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnAlberta\fscx110\c&H2E383B&\frz159.544\pos(394.5,633)\fax-0.21}Employment Agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:17.68,Default,Man,0,0,0,,My old colleague is working as an assistant director with the principal contractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:22.43,Default,Man,0,0,0,,He's looking for a young person who can manage a site.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:23.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:26.02,Default,Man,0,0,0,,First as a trainee,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.98,Default,Man,0,0,0,,but of course eventually as full staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:34.53,Default,Man,0,0,0,,They said they'll pay... about this much, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:36.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:40.32,Default,Man,0,0,0,,And I'm thinking of recommending you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:43.37,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Would you be interested in going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:48.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,W-Wait a moment please. Are you firing me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.75,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Don't get it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:53.21,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He's recommending you because he cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:56.01,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I won't ask you to make a decision now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:58.76,Default,Man,0,0,0,,But I hope you would give it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:00.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:04.72,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,What's there to hesitate over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:09.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I was thinking of building my career at this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:13.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Besides, you're more of an immediate help than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:15.82,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I'm bad at socializing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:18.90,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I can be a technician but can't be a manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:22.12,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You're younger, so you have more potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:24.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But this is too sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:27.08,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,If you take the offer, your pay will go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:31.12,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You'll eventually be supporting a family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.25,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:38.97,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,If there's someone important to you, then it's not too difficult to overcome several obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:45.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did you start working here thinking things like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:51.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. That was a personal question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.65,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You want to hear an old story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.91,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,A story of a boy who sang rock in this city before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:08.08,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He had done whatever he wanted since he was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:12.87,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Nobody ever yelled at him,\Nso he was always doing bad things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:17.63,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Back then, the band scene was booming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:20.88,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,So he picked up a guitar, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:25.35,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Like running up on other people's stages and stealing the mike away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:27.06,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He was being ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:33.69,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,When he was a senior in high school, he met a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.19,0:07:38.36,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,She said she liked the love song he sang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:44.53,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It had embarrassing lyrics,\Nbut she earnestly read the meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:48.03,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Though, she was a clumsy one, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:55.17,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,she forgot she was in the middle of heading to class because she talked for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:01.72,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,After graduation, he was planning to live on music.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:07.80,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Everyone in class laughed at him, but that teacher encouraged him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:12.48,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,She said, "As long as you continue, it will come true, so don't give up."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:16.40,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,On the day he left, he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:21.49,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,"I'll definitely become a professional! If I do, please go out with me!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:27.99,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He etched in his heart that he would become a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:33.79,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,The debut came pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:35.67,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,"Take that!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:39.92,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He wanted to say that to all those who had made fun of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:44.84,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,From that day on, he worked frantically.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:48.30,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He sang what he wanted with everything he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:49.97,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Like spitting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:51.97,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Like vomiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.14,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,At times, he sang ugly lines, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:10.24,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,But when he sang with everything he had, it sounded beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:14.33,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Living really felt refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:20.09,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Because to live was the ugliest act.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:25.76,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He had found his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:33.60,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,One day, a project was brought in from a TV station.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:36.43,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It was to meet fans of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:38.85,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Not just any fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:45.36,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Fans that had been saved by his music and were still facing adversity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.61,0:09:47.78,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Those who were sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:49.53,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Those who had gotten in accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.16,0:09:52.83,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Those who were going through tremendous hardship because of their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:58.29,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Those who had weak minds and were about to break down at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:03.88,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,They all stood in the midst of suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:09.68,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,They all used his songs for support.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:17.18,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It was a moment he knew his song no longer belonged only to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:23.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Until that day, he had only sung for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.48,0:10:26.74,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,But that was no longer true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:34.62,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He had to start composing for thousands of people he had never even met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:45.71,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He became unable to compose music.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.59,0:10:48.30,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Because he had learned...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:49.80,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,...the grandeur of life...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:51.18,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,...his shallowness...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:53.30,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,...and his insignificance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:56.72,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,The agency told him to take a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.02,0:11:00.23,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,And six months later...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:05.57,Signs,Yos,0,0,0,,{\blur1\an5\fnArial\fs72\b1\c&000000&\pos(1263,781.5)\t(0,1030,\c&H514E61&)}Trouble between friends?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:01.60,0:11:05.57,Signs,Yos,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\fad(500,0)\an5\fnArial\fs39\pos(589.5,741)\fscx90\c&H9A9598&\3c&H000000&\t(0,1030,\c&H838186&\3c&HEEF2F6&)}21 Year Old Arrested For Assault
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.60,0:11:05.57,Signs,Yos,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(500,0)\an5\fnArial\fs39\pos(589.5,741)\fscx90\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(0,1030,\c&H838186&\3c&HEEF2F6&)\bord3}21 Year Old Arrested For Assault
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:05.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,A boy he had met through the TV program committed a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:09.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,A huge crime that couldn't be forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:15.28,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Everything fell apart from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:22.33,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,The one who had committed the crime was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.88,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,...the one who said, "Listening to your songs calms my heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.59,0:11:29.88,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,"I want to hear your new song soon," the boy had said, speaking more enthusiastically than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:34.43,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He thought everything was his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:41.27,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He thought he had taken away\Nthe boy's reason to live by not singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.73,0:11:47.65,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He started singing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:51.11,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He sang of the impossible and ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:55.82,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,thinking that would save those who waited for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:12:01.83,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He didn't have a clue why he was singing such words himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:05.50,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,But he continued to sing, ignoring the doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:13.30,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,The songs eventually deviated from ideals and began to be echoes of a sick reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:17.55,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Only realistic pain could be attained from the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.35,0:12:20.14,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,The lyrics didn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:22.02,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,They contradicted each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.31,0:12:25.81,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Even then, he continued to sing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:29.90,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,...because he feared the loss of singing the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:31.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He resorted to the worst choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:40.08,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It was an unforgivable mistake.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:38.70,0:12:41.21,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnArial\fs42\b1\pos(582,673.5)\3c&H5D597B&\bord0\blur1\c&HFEFCFC&\t(1570,2487,\c&H000000&)}Yoshino Yusuke Suspect
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.70,0:12:41.21,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\an5\fnArial\fs42\b1\pos(582,673.5)\3c&H5D597B&\bord2.4\c&HFEFCFC&\t(1570,2487,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Yoshino Yusuke Suspect
Dialogue: 2,0:12:38.70,0:12:41.21,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\an5\fnArial\fs72\b1\bord0\c&HFEFCFC&\3c&H553C4D&\pos(1707,795)\t(1570,2487,\c&H000000&)}Famous Rock Star
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.70,0:12:41.21,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.4\an5\fnArial\fs72\b1\bord4.5\c&HFEFCFC&\3c&H553C4D&\pos(1707,795)\t(1570,2487,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Famous Rock Star
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:47.13,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,No place was left for him after committing the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:53.17,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,With nothing to rely on, in the depths of desperation, he made one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:55.63,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,"I want to go home."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.97,0:13:41.18,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Are you keeping up with music?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:44.72,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Everything had changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.77,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It couldn't have stayed the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:53.57,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,As long as you continue, it will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.57,0:13:57.86,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,There was something he never should have lost sight of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.95,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He should have continued singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:05.95,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Not for anyone else, but for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.33,0:14:07.50,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,The love songs for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.46,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Hey, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:14.92,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,That's the end of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:15.63,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.92,0:14:17.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:20.39,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.39,0:14:20.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:24.10,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Don't lose track of what's important to you. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:26.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:32.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.98,0:14:37.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think you should choose the path you think is best. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:38.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:43.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll be transferred to another office, but you won't stop me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.83,0:14:48.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I won't, since it's proof that they've recognized how hard you've been working.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:50.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.46,0:14:51.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:55.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:56.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:01.30,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:04.39,Default,Iso,0,0,0,,You won't play with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:05.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:10.02,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,You'd rather be with your girlfriend than play with children, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:14.27,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Really, look at how beautiful Nagisa-chan has become.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:16.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:20.07,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,You look just like me when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:21.24,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:28.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's the beach, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:30.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.62,0:15:33.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think you look kinder now, too. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:39.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You were talking with a smile to other people, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:40.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Very naturally at that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:44.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I always thought things like that were annoying. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:48.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And I say this when at school, I stuck my nose into other people's business so much. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:51.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You don't feel that way now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:15:57.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.87,0:16:07.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,May I pick it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:08.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:15.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:18.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. Please hold a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.13,0:16:23.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun. It's from Hikarizaka Electric.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:26.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Maybe the transfer went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:29.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hello, Okazaki speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:32.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, good evening, Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.85,0:16:35.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,From Kinoshita-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:39.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. What's his phone number?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:43.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:47.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.66,0:16:49.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:53.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:55.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,They got a call from my pop's acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:57.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wonder what it could be about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:02.76,Default,Kin,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Kinoshita.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:04.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:06.84,Default,Kin,0,0,0,,Oh, Tomoya-kun? We've got some trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:11.56,Default,Kin,0,0,0,,Your father got arrested by the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:14.43,Default,Kin,0,0,0,,Apparently he was dealing with some dangerous stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:17.69,Default,Kin,0,0,0,,I heard the story and figured I had to get in contact with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:26.03,Default,Man,0,0,0,,It's a small city, so rumors spread fast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.49,0:17:31.24,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Sorry, but they want to cancel the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:33.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:38.62,Default,Man,0,0,0,,But of course, continue to work here like you have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:42.84,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I guess things just happened at a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.05,0:17:45.88,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Hold the course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:50.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:51.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you want to leave this city together?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.52,0:17:56.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I realized from this event.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.64,0:17:58.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm cursed by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:02.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I want to start over in a place where his curse won't reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.03,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:08.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's just running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You can't run away from something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:16.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want you to make me have a happy life...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:18.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:21.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can make that happen away from this city!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.59,0:18:26.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You won't say that I'm all you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:32.43,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I would go anywhere if you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:38.10,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But we have to leave this city on a positive note if we are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:41.94,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Otherwise, this place won't become a place to come back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:47.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,This is the city in which we were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:49.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:53.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even if there's nothing good about this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.37,0:18:57.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I had many good things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:02.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The best is that I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:17.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:21.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What do you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:26.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is it fun ruining other people's lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:30.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't consider you my parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:34.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But society doesn't think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:37.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:43.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't even have anything to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:47.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't you have anything to say to your son who you've caused so many problems for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:53.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop screwing with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:54.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:59.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's enough. I've got nothing more to say to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:01.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Live like that forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:02.27,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:12.40,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.91,0:20:15.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:26.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:40.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:47.10,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:48.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:10.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Does your hand hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:11.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.30,0:21:14.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll sting when you get in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:16.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.14,0:21:21.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:23.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:25.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.19,0:21:31.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:36.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I've always been thinking that you're the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:38.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm a guy like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:41.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm a really pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:42.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:48.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But if we're together, we can become strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:56.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Will you always be with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.80,0:21:58.43,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.05,0:22:01.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:02.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No matter when.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.35,0:22:04.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No matter how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:43.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.11,0:23:46.08,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please! No one was bothered by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:49.12,Default,San,0,0,0,,Neither Nagisa, me, nor Akio-san was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.75,0:23:51.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But society is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.21,0:23:55.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,As proof, I lost a position due to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.88,0:23:59.26,Default,San,0,0,0,,But there's more than one path to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.80,0:24:03.05,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,He really is like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.59,0:24:06.43,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I was frantic to become an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 13
